# Build context is the repo ROOT. BuildKit uses this file INSTEAD of the
# repo-root .dockerignore, which excludes docs/. An allowlist of what the
# Dockerfile COPYs, so nothing else in the repo is ever sent.
*
!platform/mcp/pyproject.toml
!platform/mcp/uv.lock
!platform/mcp/hexgate_mcp
!docs/policy
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
